{"title": "Mindreader", "pageid": 20536, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mindreader", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp, /w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mindreader</b> is a passive feature that gives <a href=\"/wiki/Ranged_Attack\" title=\"Ranged Attack\">Ranged Attacks</a> against the creature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Ranged attacks have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> against this creature. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mindreader\"> Condition: Mindreader </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mindreader_(Condition)\" title=\"Mindreader (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mindreader\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mindreader_(Condition)\" title=\"Mindreader (Condition)\">Mindreader</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Ranged attacks have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> against this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aicir_Tapol\" title=\"Aicir Tapol\">Aicir Tapol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chelvin\" title=\"Chelvin\">Chelvin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doppelganger\" title=\"Doppelganger\">Doppelganger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edward_Tremby\" title=\"Edward Tremby\">Edward Tremby</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gujj\" title=\"Gujj\">Gujj</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira_(doppelganger)\" title=\"Jaheira (doppelganger)\">Jaheira (doppelganger)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(doppelganger)\" title=\"Koll (doppelganger)\">Koll (doppelganger)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leistine\" title=\"Leistine\">Leistine</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leysin\" title=\"Leysin\">Leysin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ludd\" title=\"Ludd\">Ludd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\">Olfaith Olumssdottir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Podd\" title=\"Podd\">Podd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rigg\" title=\"Rigg\">Rigg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rull\" title=\"Rull\">Rull</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Soxx\" title=\"Soxx\">Soxx</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thonos\" title=\"Thonos\">Thonos</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wobb\" title=\"Wobb\">Wobb</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Woyy\" title=\"Woyy\">Woyy</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The penalty applies to <i>any</i> attack rolls made 3 m (10 ft) away from the target, not just ranged ones.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714180534\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 985/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7419/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2864/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1135/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643601/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.205      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.205      1 -total\n 37.53%   14.715      1 Template:PageSeo\n 36.76%   14.413      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.07%   10.614      2 Template:Icon_link\n 26.11%   10.238      2 Template:Icon_text\n 23.79%    9.325      2 Template:Disadvantage\n 22.56%    8.844      5 Template:Trim\n 18.44%    7.228      2 Template:Ifempty\n 17.37%    6.809      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20536-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714180534 and revision id 395215. Rendering was triggered becaus